# Per-file exemptions for scripts/lint-hygiene.sh (one path or glob per line).
# Reserved for app-managed configs the app rewrites on its own terms.

# The local Codex profile is a chezmoi modify template (#71): Codex rewrites
# the deployed file with its own runtime state, so the source holds template
# syntax, not TOML, and the TOML check cannot parse it. The TOML it renders is
# checked by scripts/test-ai-config.sh instead (static managed block always,
# full render when chezmoi is installed).
private_dot_codex/modify_private_harmon-local.config.toml

# The Antigravity CLI settings are a chezmoi modify template for the same
# reason: Antigravity appends to trustedWorkspaces itself. The JSON it renders
# is checked by scripts/test-ai-config.sh.
private_dot_gemini/antigravity-cli/modify_private_settings.json

# The Claude Code user settings are a chezmoi modify template for the same
# reason (#48): Claude Code writes the file itself. Its managed values live in
# .chezmoitemplates/claude-settings/*.json, which are plain JSON and checked.
private_dot_claude/modify_private_settings.json
